@startuml ZipShiftRuntimeDeployment
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam ComponentBorderColor #0f766e
skinparam ComponentBackgroundColor #f0fdfa
skinparam DatabaseBorderColor #1d4ed8
skinparam DatabaseBackgroundColor #eff6ff
skinparam CloudBorderColor #7c3aed
skinparam CloudBackgroundColor #f5f3ff
skinparam FolderBorderColor #64748b
skinparam FolderBackgroundColor #f8fafc
hide stereotype

title ZipShift Navigator — Runtime and Deployment

node "Developer machine" as Dev {
  component "Vite dev server\n:3000" as Vite
  component "Express API\n:3001" as DevApi
  folder "client/src\nReact + Vite source" as ClientSource
  folder "server\nExpress + TypeScript" as ServerSource
  folder "server/migrations/*.sql" as Migrations
  component "tsx / Vitest / TypeScript" as Tooling
}

node "Production application host" as Prod {
  component "dist/index.js\nExpress process" as ProdApi
  folder "dist/public\ncompiled SPA assets" as Static
}

database "Managed MySQL / MariaDB" as DB
cloud "Private object storage" as Storage
actor "Browser / PWA" as Browser

Browser --> Vite : local development
Vite --> DevApi : proxy /api/*
ClientSource --> Vite : build and HMR
ServerSource --> DevApi : tsx runtime
Tooling --> ClientSource : test / compile
Tooling --> ServerSource : test / compile
Migrations --> DB : ordered migration apply

Browser --> ProdApi : HTTPS /api/*
ProdApi --> Static : serve SPA + fallback
ProdApi --> DB : DATABASE_URL pool
ProdApi --> Storage : signed file URLs
ServerSource --> Prod : build / bundle
ClientSource --> Static : Vite production build

note right of DB
The cursor/index migration is applied
before enabling cursor pagination and
idempotent event retries in production.
end note

note bottom of ProdApi
One Express service owns API domains,
static hosting, authentication, storage
orchestration, and error handling.
end note
@enduml
